# Strict allowlist: ignore everything by default, then un-ignore only the
# files we want backed up to the programs-meta repo.
#
# Per-app git repos under this folder (e.g. School Scrips/Macro App/.git,
# electron-toolbar/.git) are unaffected — git treats their .git directories
# as boundary stops and never tracks anything inside them.

# Ignore every top-level entry
/*

# Un-ignore the meta files we care about
!/CLAUDE.md
!/cursor-patterns/
!/.gitignore
node_modules
